  "If all | you're focused on",
  "is *success, | success, success,",
  "success, | success,",
  "you're going | to be",
  "*obsessed",
  "and you're not | going to be",
  "able to see | as *clearly.",
  "All beings work | without *exception.",
  "If they live | without *possessiveness,",
  "act without | *presumption,",
  "and do not | dwell on *success,",
  "then by this | very *non-dwelling",
  "success | will not leave.",
  "So you just | do your *work,",
  "do your *best,",
  "try not to | make *assumptions,",
  "don't lie | to *yourself",
  "or to others,",
  "and just | keep *going",
  "and don't be | *preoccupied",
  "with this abstract | *construct.",
  "In America | these days,",
  "*success is | measured",
  "almost entirely | in terms of",
  "*money | and fame,",
  "which is *crazy, | insanity,",
  "because money | brings no *peace",
